adding: 0px\">-</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">1000 lb</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">500</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">-</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 \u2022\u2022</b></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">5 mi</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">decade</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">-</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">-</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">tons</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">1000</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\">-</td> </tr> </table></div> When targeting mundane animals, add + <b>\u2022\u2022</b> for small animals, or + <b>\u2022</b> for medium sized animals.<br /> <br /> <b>Optional system:</b> Sympathetic Connection has been reworked as a Casting Aid along with a few new ones. Each aid decreases the total number of successes needed for casting Rituals, and thus allow for more extended use of Aspects.<br /> <br /> Casting Aid table: <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>Sympathetic</b><br /> <b>Connection</b></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>Correspondence</b><br /> <b>Components</b></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px\"><b>Ritual Time</b></td> <td class=\